id: pm-gantt-chart-deadline-repair
title: Propose minimal explicit repairs for infeasible deadlines
description: Enumerate small schedule-specific capacity shifts and scope deferrals using existing infeasible-deadline detection.
type: Feature
status: in_progress
priority: 2
tags: []
